263
00:20:30,020 --> 00:23:03,900
In the memories of Ancient God Tu Si, there was one line he used to describe the Moongazer Serpents.\N“If the law of the heavens has a spirit, then the Ancient Gods have Moongazers!”\NThe spirit can be considered a soul. In short, the first half of the sentence states that the heavens are alive. They have their own existence or a sense of spirit that normal creatures can’t detect.\NThe second half is referring to the Moongazer Serpent. Even Ancient God Tu Si didn’t know how the Moongazer Serpents came to be. They seemed to have already existed for a very long time. It was like the heavens and their spirit, both were elusive things that no one could explain.\N\NYou might wonder how Wang Lin was able to use his Life Seals after he had extracted them previously. He had stored his Life Seals inside his Celestial Guard for it to use them. They just can't regenerate anymore.\N\NWang Lin almost lost his wits. This finger was too fast, and it was quickly closing in. In the midst of this crisis, Wang Lin’s eyes became cold and he placed his hand on the celestial guard. He extracted the slaughter energy from the celestial guard. In an instant, almost one million strands of slaughter energy appeared. They transformed into life seals to block the ancient god finger!\NThe life seals all collapsed as if they were fragile pieces of paper. It didn’t matter how much slaughter energy was used, all of it was powerless before the ancient god finger.

